Strip the sourcegraph code-search tool (PATCH_OUT_SOURCEGRAPH, default 0 = kept).

Removes every registration of the sourcegraph tool — the Coder tool list
(internal/agent/coordinator.go), the agentic_fetch sub-agent tool list
(internal/agent/agentic_fetch_tool.go), and the config name lists
(internal/config/config.go) — so nothing can invoke its hardcoded
https://sourcegraph.com/.api/graphql endpoint. The tool file stays compiled
(UI code switches on its name constant); only construction is removed.

